<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>CAVERIA M12 MACRO</Major>
    <Description>THIS SMG SCRIPT FOR CAV IS SO OP BRO!

INSTRUCTIONS
Just Bind to the left mouse key, and make sure operation mode is on "HOLD UNTIL RELEASED".

DISCLAIMER!
Macro will not work if Keyran drivers are not installed

ATTACHMENTS
Sight- Holo B
Barrel- Compensater

GAME SETTINGS
Resolution-1920x1080
FOV-84
SenseHorizontal-13
SenseVertical-13
DPI-800

Made by HOODIExSZN

ENJOY!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
MoveR 0 1
Delay 5 ms
MoveR 0 1
Delay 5 ms
MoveR -1 1
Delay 5 ms
MoveR 1 1
Delay 5 ms
MoveR 0 2
Delay 5 ms
MoveR 0 2
LeftUp 1
GoWhile 1 3</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>